{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_erato_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_erato_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"英雄们的叙事诗","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_erato_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"a7375ae12e4f28ff50a63c63cba59a9113436fe8b62d1bbb914b7d070024479c","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咕咚，咕咚——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，美酒的芬芳，真令人陶醉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"开门，埃拉托小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃拉托——你把自己关在里面也想不出来的，我建议你放弃。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"酗酒祭司，你太吵了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是关心你，埃拉托小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨夜我徜徉美酒之时，偶然听到干员们的交谈，听闻你将自己关在宿舍里两天两夜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"身为祭司，我自然牵挂着你的情况。你看，清晨的日光才刚刚铺满窗沿，我就前来探望你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"探望我......你手上拎着的是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"佳酿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"米诺斯的群山啊，可否赐予我不被酒品奇差之人骚扰的恩泽？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你尚有讽刺的力气，新诗篇的创作一定很顺利吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你怎么知道我正在创作一部新的诗篇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来到罗德岛之后，你已经游手好闲够久了......准备写点什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一部长篇诗歌，讲述几位所长不同、性格各异的英雄，合力带领备受压迫的人们战胜困难，共同前往希望之地......大概是这样的故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而在开始动笔时，我还是遇上阻碍了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一字未动？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡说，我......至少写上了标题！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在故事前期，我设想了三位英雄，分别是善战的勇士、天才的工匠和仁爱的医生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可由于搁笔太久，我对角色的理解已经生疏了，构思的故事缺乏真实感，角色形象难以建立......我需要更多的灵感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不如就像我们在故乡那样，一边痛饮美酒，一边畅叙诸山之间的英雄传说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"酣醉之时，灵感便如树上熟透的果实一般任你采摘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请不要为你带酒上门找理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"翻阅典籍，或是外出采风？米诺斯的诗人们善用这些方法，你应当比我更清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，我这不就准备出发去寻找英雄事迹了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说起英雄事迹，除我们的故乡外，维多利亚与卡西米尔应该是合适的采风地，或许还有其他的选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不会跑这么远，我已经想好要去哪些地方了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闲聊还是下次吧，我得抓紧时间了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请留步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃拉托小姐如何创作诗篇，我一直对此非常感兴趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是一次难逢的机会，若我想与你同行，你应该不会拒绝吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟上我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_trainingcom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里就是我计划的第一站。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出乎意料，埃拉托小姐，原来你就没有计划离开罗德岛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然啦，在本舰上就足够我寻找灵感了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说起善战的勇士，那必定是在训练室最容易遇上了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我们来太早了吗？似乎没有人在......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈，这拳如何？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人在说话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也听到了——你好？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"尝尝这拳！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是燧石小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"你是帕拉斯，还有你，你是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"你个子不高，也很少来训练场打架，我不记得你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我叫埃拉托，大部分时间都在出外勤任务，我们确实只有几面之缘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"好，你们好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，埃拉托，要来打架吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸！怎么突然——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"你不想打架，那算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我不擅长近身格斗，射箭的话倒是可以比试一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"（转向沙袋）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"哈！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等待一下吧，这个时间，再过一会儿就会有其他干员前来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃拉托小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然过去就听过燧石小姐很厉害，但战斗姿态的燧石小姐我还是第一次见到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这矫健的身姿，凌厉的拳风......啊，这不就是我在寻找的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"燧石小姐，不，能征善战的勇士啊！你的经历一定非同凡响，我想要了解你的英雄事迹，能与我分享一二吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"英雄？我没见过什么英雄，你说的我听不懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"你要这些什么......事迹有用吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我正在寻找能给予我灵感的英雄事迹，为了帮助我创作出一部伟大的诗篇！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，明白了，你是想要灵感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"那你过来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"过来，站这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"这是沙袋，揍它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......这样吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"力气太小了，使点劲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"还不够，再用力。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈！疼疼疼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"对，就是这样，你感觉到什么了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"疼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"还有呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能，你没有感受到灵感吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"完全没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"真奇怪，我打拳的时候就会有很多灵感，比如说会突然想到，下一次可以佯攻面门而直击下盘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"任何麻烦应该都能用拳头来解决，我想想，应该是你打得太少了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"来，再多打几拳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先停一停......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"后勤干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"燧石，燧石，你在里面吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"我在这里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"后勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，埃拉托，帕拉斯，两位也在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"后勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"燧石，这是上一次外勤任务的赔偿清单，你好好看看。为了处理你出外勤留下的麻烦，后勤部又多了一大笔支出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"后勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"特别是这一项，你在任务报告中写的是：“因为那个高个子的家伙眼神凶恶地俯视我，我就把他打倒了。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"后勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"你何止是把他打倒了，他可是痛得满地打滚，足足撞烂了两扇门！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能，我明明收了力的。你看，我就是这么打了两下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"后勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，以后出外勤任务，千万要注意不要破坏公物，要是再有下次——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沙袋......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被一拳打爆了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"后勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，算了。燧石，这个给你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"后勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"上次外勤任务中，你救下的那个女孩寄给你的感谢信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"（把信塞进拳套里）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"我去换个新沙袋。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然，埃拉托小姐，我的选择没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"与你同行实在尽兴，甚至胜过在舰桥上自斟自饮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你们祭司都这样说话，还是只有你这么无聊，“胜利女神”小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道，我是独一无二的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下个地方到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛上有不少厉害的工程师，在这里一定能找到——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿！帕拉斯，埃拉托，两位，早上好啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，贾维，这里只有你在吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚奥斯塔还在呢？欸，他去哪里了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奥斯塔，你在哪儿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，不用麻烦叫他出来啦，我就问你好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得你......应该还挺擅长机械设计吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那当然了，小爷我的改装技术可是一等一的，称之为天才也不为过！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，我有个问题想问你，你有没有觉得自己有过什么英雄事迹......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喏，帮我拿着这个。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......液压钳？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是问我的改装技术吗？我学修车的时候师傅曾经说过，嘴上吹得再好听，都不如亲手做一遍来得实在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，我是想询问英雄......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拿好了，我这就给你演示一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"演示什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它怎么、怎么飞起来了？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么样？这就是我的最新作品，自悬浮液压钳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小爷我在这里工作，经常要对付一些大型设备，每次都要带着工具爬梯子实在是太麻烦了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，只要抓住经过我改装的这套工具，身体就能跟着飘起来！去再高的地方都不用搬梯子了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抓稳了！它还能飘得更高！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它、它在震动，这正常吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"震动......我记得我没装转子电机啊？等等，我到底装了没有......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它开始乱晃了！我抓不住了，要放手了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心！液压钳朝你飞过去了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎哟！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"痛，痛，我的脑袋......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么会出现这种故障呢？奇怪，是不是喷气引擎功率太大了？算了，一会儿再说吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你刚刚是不是问我，我有没有什么英雄事迹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小爷我必须自豪地告诉你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个回答倒是意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是因为，我的心血全部献给了我改装的这些机械设备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们才是真正的英雄，代替我成就了许多前无古人的壮举！我的改装才是应该被所有人铭记的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于我......我发明了它们，那我就应该算是......嗯......“英雄创造者”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，这个称号还不赖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“英雄创造者”？嘁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奥斯塔！你那声“嘁”是什么意思？你不认可我吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的英雄们是指会唱歌的电钻，还是会跳舞的扳手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，现在又多了一个会飞行的液压钳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，奥斯塔，你怎么能这么贬低你的头儿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根据我的统计，你上一次收到改装的需求，还是......三个月前？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好好回忆一下，我一定还有做得很好的改装吧！一定有吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"承认吧，贾维，你已经没救了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，桌子上的这个头盔......我似乎在前不久的一次外勤任务中见过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当时那位重装干员非常气愤地说：“我只是想修一下护目镜，那家伙竟然给我加了一大堆乱七八糟的功能！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而在任务中，小队遭遇意料之外的源石污染。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在未携带专业源石探测装备的情况下，头盔的源石探测功能起了作用，帮助小队渡过了危机。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奥斯塔，你听见了吗？我还是有能帮上忙的地方！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那这个头盔为什么被送了回来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得，在任务的后半程头盔漏电了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不论如何，我是不会放弃发挥我的创意的，我的天赋绝不能被掩埋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总有一天，小爷我也配得上堂堂正正的英雄之名，而不是什么，“英雄创造者”之类的。奥斯塔，你就等着瞧好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，差点忘了你们还在了。抱歉啊，埃拉托，没给你你要的英雄事迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我想到了，你们想要询问英雄事迹的话，我有一个人选。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是哪位？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就是小爷我的挚友，Lancet-2！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她最近格外消极啊，明明工作非常努力的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过她是不是一直都很消极......如果你们可以向她了解一些她的英雄事迹，说不定她就能开心一点！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有空常来玩啊，有想要改装的玩意也尽管找我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃拉托小姐，你真的打算听贾维的建议吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然啦，在我的计划里，要去的最后一个地方恰好也是医疗室。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这趟“旅程”至今，原谅我用了传统的“旅程”一词，你觉得会对你的创作有所帮助吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在过去我收集了许多传说与故事，为了将它们完好地保存下来，我会努力把自己当作一个忠实的记录者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不在记录中掺杂主观的情绪与思考，让故事能保持它原本的样貌，这是我的诀窍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当旅途告一段落时，那些我所见证的，所听闻的，所记录的，最终会在几个夜晚沉淀下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而后，在笔下流淌为诗歌，以我之口向众生诉说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这趟“旅程”还未结束，所以我不知道最后会有怎样的结果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"记录、创作与传颂，你让自己肩负了远超一名吟游诗人的责任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想我热衷于此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是你的自由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我有一种预感，这次的所见所闻会给我的创作带来些许不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先前我只是好奇你的创作过程，现在你会写出怎样的诗篇，我也很有兴趣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_infirmary"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"该怎么办，该怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Lancet-2，你好......你在干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"两位好，根据我的运动模块显示的状态，我在转圈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看得出来，可是，你为什么要转圈呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，因为博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士他出什么状况了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"不对，是因为我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"是因为无能的、没有作用的、什么都做不好的我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，咱们好好说清楚可以吗？究竟是发生了什么事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帕拉斯，你说我这样拍两下，Lancet-2能正常说话吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以试试。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"语言模块自检中——自检完毕，恢复运行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"原因是，博士他最近实在太忙了，每天都要处理好多文件，直到凌晨才能上床休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"这样下去，下一次博士的体检结果一定会出现异常指标的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"都是我不好，没有照顾好博士，都怪我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停停。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Lancet-2，博士有他的职责，他的工作对我们所有人都非常重要，偶尔有忙碌的时候也是正常状况哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不应该把这样的情况怪罪在自己的头上，你也在很努力地工作啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"真的吗？埃拉托干员，你真的是这么认为的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然啦，我这次前来就是想找你帮忙的。请问你有什么可以分享给我的英雄事迹吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"英雄事迹......在看护的时候我有听见干员们的闲聊，在我的存储模块中应该保存有一些事件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不，不需要那些。我想要了解的是，你觉得自己做得好的，像英雄一样的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Lancet-2的工作那么出色，这样的事情一定不少吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"我的英雄事迹......不，我应该没有足以称之为英雄事迹的行为，我连英雄都称不上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"在我的岗位上，能把所有干员都照顾得很好，让大家都保持健康，才能被称为英雄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"而我没有这样的事迹，我照顾不好博士......我是不是根本就不称职......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她真的很消极。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦好啦，Lancet-2，要不这样，请你也照看我一下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"照顾埃拉托干员吗？这的确在我的工作范围内，但是......你让我这么做有什么理由吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样我就会告诉你，你做得到底好不好，或许Lancet-2就能体会到自己也是很有用的呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了，我马上对埃拉托干员进行全身生理检测，请稍等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好哦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"检测——完成。检测结果显示，埃拉托干员有27小时13分钟27秒没有进入过睡眠状态，身体严重缺乏休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"......埃拉托干员在数小时前摄入了大量糖分，以及脂肪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃拉托小姐，你上次可是口口声声说要减肥的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这是为了构思，为了构思！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会这样？我竟然没有及时发现埃拉托干员的异常......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"你一进来我就该发现的，可是我忙于处理自己的情绪模块，没有照看好你......我太不称职了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有，这不是你的问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"果然，我什么作用都起不了，我就该自己驶向报废区域的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"埃拉托，帕拉斯，你们好。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"埃拉托，帕拉斯，你们也在这里啊。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托&帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Lancet-2，我来体检了......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你看起来状态不太好，有什么心事吗？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......对不起，我没有照顾好你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"多亏Lancet-2的帮助，我的体检结果一直正常。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，竟然是这样的吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"短暂的时间内，你完成了体检的全部内容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"体检结果出来了，各项数据指标——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"一切正常。太好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我都说了，不用担心。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"完全没有担心的必要。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"（减少了博士的咖啡配给，果然还是有用的。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Lancet-2的工作真的很出色啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"埃拉托，你还好吗？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，抱歉，我刚刚只是在思考......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我有点事，先离开了！再见！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"好，再见。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"narration","text":"一周后"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_349_chiave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来不止小爷我，大家都收到邀请了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"“诗篇吟诵会”邀请，我不懂，什么是诗篇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"是一种用凝练语言叙述事件或表达情绪的文学体裁，听众能从诗篇的吟诵中收获精神的力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"这次是埃拉托最新作品的第一次公开朗诵，预计会对干员们的心理健康带来积极的影响。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"埃拉托的新诗篇吗......我还挺期待的。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（虽说给大家都发了邀请，可没想到竟然来了这么多人......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感谢大家参加我的新诗篇吟诵会，愿大家在此度过一段惬意的时光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，话不多说，下面我将为大家吟诵的是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（深呼吸）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（啊，好紧张，上一次在这么多人面前吟诵新诗，还是好多年前在科林尼亚的城市广场......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"埃拉托！埃拉托！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，下面，我将为大家吟诵的是，我最新创作的诗篇——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"《英雄们的叙事诗》。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"辽远的天穹啊，\n请歌唱在你之下，\n那些平凡人类的意志。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在极远的边陲之地，\n群山不再，\n唯余一片黄沙与黑色石砾掩埋的荒原。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"文明正遭受苦难鞭打，\n挣扎如酒浆中的泡沫，\n无形怪物吞噬鲜活的心跳。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"然后在一个出人意料的夏夜，\n它发生了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"三位英雄，\n自生养他们的人民中走出来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他们面对阳光立下誓言，\n要率领人民打碎桎梏，\n前往鲜花盛开之地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"伴随着竖琴声与埃拉托轻缓的吟诵，三位英雄的故事被娓娓道来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他们从人民中来，\n并不高大，\n并非完美无缺。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"善战的勇士不善言辞，性子冲动。\n天才的工匠粗心自大，我行我素。\n仁爱的医生过分自卑，语言消极。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"然而，当无数危机接踵而来时。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"勇士毫不畏惧向远比自己高大的敌人发起挑战。\n工匠以一件妙手偶得的器具帮助人们脱离险境。\n医生尽心尽力地照护每一位受病痛折磨的患者。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他们从人民中来，\n并不高大，\n并非完美无缺。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他们正带领人们前行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黎明掀开她的面纱，太阳的光辉洒向大地，拂过灰尘遮蔽的脸庞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"远方飘来芬芳，人们拾起行囊，将继续踏上道路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢大家，谢谢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"诗篇吟诵会告一段落，大家恋恋不舍地离去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，帕拉斯，之前我就把诗篇读给你听了，过去了两三天，你还没有什么想法吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我没听错，这只是诗篇的第一节。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必须承认，诗篇很有你的风格，但在你的诗篇完成之前，我决定不予评价。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能让喋喋不休的帕拉斯把评价吞进肚子里，应该还不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起和你拌嘴，我更想知道你打算如何完成诗篇后续的创作。上一次收集到的素材应该不足以支撑后续写作吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，所以现在我的确没有更多的灵感，只有一个我一直都很喜欢的构想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要创作一个以我自己为原型的角色，在故事中与英雄们一起，同行至鲜花盛开的理想之地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕拉斯","speakerId":"avg_482_pallas_1","isRemote":false,"text":"米诺斯人都曾梦想过与英雄同行，我理解。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......和过去不一样，你应该记得我和你说过，这一次的创作会有所不同。可我创作的诗篇和过去相比并没有改变。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在写作时我一直思索这个预感从何而来，直到放下笔的刹那，我忽然明白，那份不同或许早已发生在我的身旁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过去的旅途中，我将自己写进故事，成为故事中的角色，期待着凝结心血的创作能引导与鼓舞人们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但身处此地，第一次认真地观察过罗德岛上的大家后，我发现......我的诗意产生了前所未有的共鸣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想我已经置身于英雄之间，正与英雄们同行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉托","speakerId":"avg_4043_erato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我应当将其记叙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_285_medic2","aliases":["Lancet-2"]},{"speakerId":"char_415_flint","aliases":["燧石"]}]}
